flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Open Customer Ledger]
    B --> C[Click 'Add Transaction']
    C --> D{Select Type}
    D -->|Credit| E[Received Payment]
    D -->|Debit| F[Give Credit/Add Balance]
    E --> G[Enter Amount & Description]
    F --> G
    G --> H[AI auto-categorizes description]
    H --> I[Save Transaction]
    I --> J[Balance updates instantly]
    J --> K{Check Balance}
    K -->|Overdue| L[Click 'Send Reminder']
    K -->|Cleared| M[End]
    L --> N[Choose Channel: WhatsApp/SMS]
    N --> O[Customer receives notification]
    O --> M